      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>Characters do not block line of sight, only elevation can do that.</p><p>Further, Omnitron is treated as 1 elevation higher than the hex he is on.</p><p>This means the elevation increase for Omnitron being in the hex is for the character only, not the hex, which mean a character moving through a hex Omnitron occupies does not account for Omnitron&#39;s increased height for movement cost.</p><p>The Elevation of the Hex is not raised, only the Character of Omniron-V.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>By rule Omnitron-V cannot block line of sight, even if he is treated as one elevation higher than the hex he is on.</p>",
